      "She searched for two full days. She opened every drawer, looked under every carpet, and shook out every book — and there were hundreds of books. She found birthday cards from the 1970s, a dried flower, two wedding photographs, and a shopping list that broke her heart with its small, careful handwriting: bread, batteries, call Shireen.",
